          964.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "We chose the GRIM method<sup>70,72</sup> to polymerize the 3,4′-disubstituted 5,5′-dibromo-2,2′-bithiophenes, 7, and thereby prepare a series of regioregular polythiophenes, Rg(Th-m,n/p), with alternating 3-alkylthiophene and 3-(semifluoroalkyl)thiophene subunits along the backbone (Figure 3)."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      },
      "copolymer_type": null,
      "material_type": null
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "s002",
      "sample_kind": "synthesis_batch",
      "refers_to_entity": "pe002",
      "polymer_name": "Rn(Th-5,4/8)",
      "polymer_type": "copolymer",
      "sample_label_raw": "Rn(Th-5,4/8)",
      "intended_use": [],
      "evidence": {
        "block_id": "P_2_36",
        "page": 2,
        "bbox": [
          514.0,
          146.0,
          932.0,
          243.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "we also prepared the regiorandom analogue, Rn(Th-5,4/8), by the oxidative polymerization<sup>64,76,77</sup> of $\\mathbf { 6 } ( m = 5 , n =$$4 , p = 8 )$in chloroform with ferric chloride."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      },
      "copolymer_type": null,
      "material_type": null
    },
