          404.0,
          933.0,
          555.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Notably, attempts to prepare Rg(Th-5,4/1) (with a short alkyl side chain, i.e., methyl) and Rg(Th-5,8/8) and Rg(Th-5,8/12) (with long heptadecafluorooctyl segments, i.e., $m = 8 )$were hindered by the insolubility of the resulting polymers."
