          964.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The difference in structure between regioregular Rg(Th-5,4/ 8) and regiorandom Rn(Th-5,4/8) is also evident in their $^ { 1 3 } \\mathrm { C }$NMR spectra (Figure 5)."
