        "source_sentence": "For example, Rg(Th-5,4/9) has a melting point of $1 9 5 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } .$, whereas the isosteric alkyl analogue, the poly(3-nonylthiophene) homopolymer, has a melting point of ${ \\mathrm { ~ \\bar { 1 } 8 6 ~ } } ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } .$"
